{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102202423930-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102220203\"/><p>被捕的私家車司機。</p><p>今晚(2日)7時許，警員巡經油麻地佐敦道近興街時，發現一輛私家車停於路邊，車上司機形迹可疑，於是上前作出截查。經過搜查，在車上起出100粒懷疑依托咪酯煙彈、及60多小包懷疑可卡因。因此，以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」罪，拘捕該名男司機。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:32.452718+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:24:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:38:16.499670+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:24.186407+00:00","content_hash":"bf73b5cd9e5a1ea3d2482e864340cbfa3a5466977693d6bea604513c4b11c585","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:32.452718+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}